Scope: this license covers the Leon Ops: Zombies Kennedy project's own work - its
changes to the engine, the mod's scripts (mods/leon), the converter
(tools/leon-converter), the launcher (tools/leon-launcher) and the Melty packaging
(tools/melty, melty.json).

It does not cover:
- the Call of Duty: Black Ops engine decompilation this project is built on
  (https://github.com/MisaDev4/bo1-zombies-decompiled), which stays under its
  authors' terms, nor Activision's game it reconstructs;
- the third-party code and tools it uses or credits (see README.md), each under
  its own license;
- Call of Duty: Black Ops (Activision) or Resident Evil 4 and Leon S. Kennedy
  (Capcom). No file from either game is in this repository or its releases.
